{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42946","headline":"辛司法宅观妓 · 王积","name":"辛司法宅观妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南国佳人至，北堂罗荐开。\n长裙随凤管，促柱送鸾杯。\n云光身後落，雪态掌中回。\n到愁金谷晚，不怪玉山颓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王积","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}